<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thessalonika</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thessalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thessalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvanus leh Timothi in i Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist a Thessalonika khuo a um hattuom kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist a kipat hepina leh lungmuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute aw, na ginna uh nasatah a, akhan let a, khat leh khat na ki it tuona uh akhan semsem zieha, na tungtang thu ua bawl tuoh ahimabangin, Pasian kunga kipahthu gen den ding mawng ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi’n noute ahing bawlsietnate u’leh na gimthuohnate zousie ua, na thuohhat dan u’leh, na gindan zousie uh ziehin Pasian hattuom lah ah ka hing suong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khu Pasian gam mi a sim taah na hi theina ding ua, Pasian vaihawmna dihtatna kichientah ahia, tuami ding ma a zong genthei thuoh na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nou hing subuoite gimthuohna a thuh khu Pasian a ding a sil dihtat huoi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh nou suhgim a umte pen, Mangpa Jesu van a kipat a avansawlsieng hattah toh ahing kilah chiengin, koute toh khawldamna ahing pekhawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meikuonga ahing kilah chiengin, Pasian theiloute leh i Mangpa Jesu Khrist khantanhoi thumang loute phuba ala ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute pen Mangpa mai leh asilbawl theina thupitah akipan in kumtawn manthaina ah gawt in aum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni chienga, Ama ahing pei a, amisiengthoute a suhthupi a aum a, agingta mi zousie lah a lamdang sah a aum ni chiengin. Noute lah a theipina thu ka gen uh na gintat zieh un, noute zong agingta mite lah a telkha na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin i Pasian un ahing hatna toh kituoh a sim taah ahing sah theina ding leh hoina leh ginna nasep zousie asilbawltheina toh atangtunsah theina dingin, noute a dingin zong thu ka ngen ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I Pasian u’leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina dungzui a noute i Mangpa Jesu Khrist min pahtawi a aum a, Ama a noute pahtawi a na umna ding un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin unaute aw, i Mangpa Jesu Khrist hing pei na ding leh eite Ama kunga i kikhop khawm na ding thu toh kisai in, ka hing ngen uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa ni khu ahing tung zouta chi hagau in ahiei, thuin ahiei, tualeh koute akipan laihah ahiei in na lungsim uh kiling sah sih unlen, ahisihleh buoi pai sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banglam tengah koiman hing sol zou sih heh, aziehpen puasanna ahing tun masah a, khelna mipa mangthang tapa hing kilang masa louin, tua ni hing tunglou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama pen miten Pasian achi pouma u’leh abieh pouma uh douin tuate tungah ama leh ama akitawisang dinga, Pasian kihisah in Pasian biehinn ah Pasian bangin atou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kung ua ka um lai in, tam silte ka hing hilta chi thei nawnlou na hi uoi mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh tuin ama pen ama hun tah a ahing kilat ding bang ahiei adal chi na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen Danbei a gamtatna thuguh in asem panta hi, Ama dalpa lampi apat lahmang ahi masangsiein, Ama adal zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuazou chiengin danbei a gamtapa ahing kilang dinga, Mangpa Jesu’n akam a huin akatum ding a, tualeh ahing peina vah in, danbei a gamtapa asumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua danbei a gamtapa hing pei khu Setan nasepna dungzui a, silbawltheinate, chiemtenate leh zuouthu lamdangte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh mangthaite adingin dihtatlouna solna zousie toh ahi dinga, hundam ahi theina ding ua, thutah itna apomlou zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami ziehin zuouthu agintat na dingun, Pasian in dihlouna nasep hattah akung uah asawl dinga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thutah gingtalou a, dihtatlouna kipahpite zousie mawpai in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh unau Mangpa ittahte aw, hagau a suhsiengthouna leh thutah ginna zieha, hundam a um dinga achiil a kipat Pasian in noute ahing tel ziehin koute pen noute dinga Pasian kunga kipahthu gen ngitnget ding mawng ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khantanhoi genna zieh un, Aman i Mangpa Jesu Khrist thupina tangdingin noute ahing han hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin unaute dingkip unlen, thu gen hiin, ka laihah un hitaleh, thugousie noute ka hing hilte uh tudet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin i Mangpa Jesu Khrist Ama ngel leh eite hing it Pasian leh i Pa uh hepina zal a kumtawn hamuonna leh kinepna hing pepa’n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungtang uh hing hamuonin, thugen leh nasep hoi chintengah hing sudet tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atawp pen in unaute aw, Mangpa thu noute a aum banga khanga suhthupi a aumtheina ding leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mitatsete leh mi giloute laha kipat ka bit theina dingun thu hing nget pieh un, aziehpen mizousie in ginna anei kim sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa khu a ginum a, Aman noute ahing sudet dinga, mi gilou lah ah ahing veng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na kung ua ka hing thupiehte uh, na bawl ua na bawl zel ding uh chi Mangpa ah ka hing muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin Mangpa’n na lungtangte uh, Pasian itna, leh Khrist thuohhatna ah hing pui heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute aw, koute apat a thugousie namute uh banga umlou a, dan banglou a gamta sanggamte zousie lah a kihemkhe dingin i Mangpa Jesu Khrist min in thu ka hing pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute mama in na hing zui dan uh na thei uhi, aziehpen na lah uah dan banglouin ka gamta ngai sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Koima tanghou aman beiin ka ne ngai sih ua, na lah ua koima ka suhbuoi louna ding un gimtahin sun leh zan in ka semgim zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuneina ka neilou zieh uh ahi sih a, hinanleh na hing zui ding ua etton dingin kouma leh kouma ka kibawl zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kung ua ka um lai nangawn un tam thu ka hing pie uhi, koipou in nna asep nuom sih leh nezong ne sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen na lah ua dan bangloua gamta a, nasep mawngmawng donlou a, kitahla taha mi nasepna tengah akikumthaw mi aum uhi, chi ka za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabang mite pen nna sem khinkhien ding leh amauh tanghou ki neh dingin, Mangpa Jesu Khrist min in thu pie in ka hanthawn zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh unaute, noute’n vang sil hoi bawl chimtah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Koipou in tam laihah a ka thuhil uh azui sih leh tua mi khu chiemte unlen, azum theina ding in kigoppi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh melma bangin bawl sih unlen, sanggam bangin vauhil zaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin hamuonna Mangpa mama in lamchinteng ah, bangchih lai pouin noute hamuonna hing peta hen. Mangpa’n na unpi un hing umpita hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam ka hing nousietna lai pen Kei Paul in keima khut ngel a ka gel ahi, ka laihahte zousie ah chiemtena hi dingin tambangin ka giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina in na unpi un hing umpi ta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
